<view class="{{'panel'}}" aria-label="全平台账户余额">
  <view>
    <view>
      <text class="overline">PLATFORM WALLETS</text>
      <view>各账户余额</view>
    </view>
    <text>跨组织 · 每次读取都会写审计 · 最多 100 个组织</text>
  </view>
  <view>这一栏与「财务对账」的租户视图不同：它不带组织头，看到的是全部租户的钱。 能不能看由数据库里的平台管理员名单决定，本地角色只决定 BFF 转不转发。</view>
  <view class="{{'inlineActions'}}">
    <button class="secondary-button" type="button" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="onTap">
      <Icon name="{{busy ? &quot;refresh&quot; : &quot;search&quot;}}" size="{{17}}" />
      <text>{{busy ? "读取中…" : "读取全平台余额"}}</text>
    </button>
  </view>
  <view wx:if="{{denial}}" class="{{'bad'}}" role="alert">被拒绝或读取失败： {{denial}}</view>
  <view wx:if="{{notice}}" class="{{'good'}}" role="status">{{notice}}</view>
  <view wx:if="{{!loaded}}" class="{{'empty'}}">
    <Icon name="database" size="{{22}}" />
    <text>点击读取后才会请求；页面不会预取全平台资金数据。</text>
  </view>
  <block wx:else>
    <view wx:if="{{wallets.length === 0}}" class="{{'empty'}}">
      <Icon name="database" size="{{22}}" />
      <text>没有钱包。租户首次充值或首次收到人工调整后才会出现。</text>
    </view>
    <view wx:else class="{{'tableWrap'}}">
      <view>
        <view>
          <view>
            <view>组织</view>
            <view>余额</view>
            <view>冻结中</view>
            <view>可用</view>
            <view>持有笔数</view>
            <view>状态</view>
            <view>更新时间</view>
            <view>流水</view>
          </view>
        </view>
        <view>
          <view wx:for="{{wallets}}" wx:for-item="row" wx:key="row.id" key="{{row.organizationId}}">
            <view>
              <text>{{row.displayName ?? row.organizationId}}</text>
              <br />
              <code>{{row.organizationId}}</code>
            </view>
            <view>{{yuan(row.balanceMinor)}}</view>
            <view>{{yuan(row.reservedMinor)}}</view>
            <view>{{yuan(row.spendableMinor)}}</view>
            <view>{{row.heldReservations}}</view>
            <view>
              <text class="{{row.walletStatus === &quot;ACTIVE&quot; ? 'resultGood' : 'resultBad'}}">{{row.walletStatus}}</text>
            </view>
            <view>{{moment(row.updatedAt)}}</view>
            <view>
              <button class="secondary-button" type="button" disabled="{{ledgerBusy}}" bindtap="onTap">
                <Icon name="{{expanded === row.organizationId ? &quot;close&quot; : &quot;file&quot;}}" size="{{16}}" />
                <text>{{expanded === row.organizationId ? "收起" : "查看"}}</text>
              </button>
            </view>
          </view>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </block>
</view>
<view wx:if="{{expanded}}" class="{{'panel'}}" aria-label="账户流水">
  <view>
    <view>
      <text class="overline">LEDGER</text>
      <view>{{expanded}} 的流水</view>
    </view>
    <text>最近 50 条 · 新的在前 · 只读且不可修改</text>
  </view>
  <view class="{{'boundaryNote'}}">流水只记录真实的资金移动（充值入账、消费、退款、人工调整、试用赠送）。 任务开始时的冻结与结束时的释放是预留状态的变化，不在这里——否则同一列 「结余」在不同的行上会是两个意思，账本也就无法靠重放自证。</view>
  <view wx:if="{{ledgerBusy}}" class="{{'empty'}}">
    <Icon name="refresh" size="{{22}}" />
    <text>读取中…</text>
  </view>
  <block wx:else>
    <view wx:if="{{ledger.length === 0}}" class="{{'empty'}}">
      <Icon name="database" size="{{22}}" />
      <text>这个组织还没有资金流水。</text>
    </view>
    <view wx:else class="{{'tableWrap'}}">
      <view>
        <view>
          <view>
            <view>#</view>
            <view>类型</view>
            <view>方向</view>
            <view>金额</view>
            <view>结余</view>
            <view>来源</view>
            <view>操作者</view>
            <view>原因</view>
            <view>时间</view>
          </view>
        </view>
        <view>
          <view wx:for="{{ledger}}" wx:for-item="entry" wx:key="entry.id" key="{{entry.entryId}}">
            <view>{{entry.seq}}</view>
            <view>
              <code>{{entry.entryType}}</code>
            </view>
            <view>
              <text class="{{entry.direction === &quot;CREDIT&quot; ? 'resultGood' : 'resultBad'}}">{{entry.direction === "CREDIT" ? "入" : "出"}}</text>
            </view>
            <view>{{yuan(entry.amountMinor)}}</view>
            <view>{{yuan(entry.balanceAfterMinor)}}</view>
            <view title="{{entry.sourceRef}}">
              <text>{{entry.sourceType}}</text>
              <br />
              <code>{{entry.sourceRef.length > 28 ? `${entry.sourceRef.slice(0, 25)}…` : entry.sourceRef}}</code>
            </view>
            <view title="{{entry.actorId}}">
              <code>{{entry.actorId.slice(0, 12)}} …</code>
            </view>
            <view>{{entry.reason ?? "—"}}</view>
            <view>{{moment(entry.occurredAt)}}</view>
          </view>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </block>
</view>
<view class="{{'panel'}}" aria-label="充值对账">
  <view>
    <view>
      <text class="overline">TOP-UP RECONCILIATION</text>
      <view>充值与挂单</view>
    </view>
    <text>已付款但未入账： {{loaded ? uncredited.length : "—"}}</text>
  </view>
  <view wx:if="{{uncredited.length > 0}}" class="{{'bad'}}" role="alert">有 {{uncredited.length}} 笔已收款但没有入账。这一栏应该常年为空——非空即事故： 钱已经收了，而客户的余额没有变。先查支付回调有没有到，再查回调有没有找到这张单。</view>
  <view wx:if="{{!loaded}}" class="{{'empty'}}">
    <Icon name="database" size="{{22}}" />
    <text>与余额一同读取。</text>
  </view>
  <block wx:else>
    <view wx:if="{{topups.length === 0}}" class="{{'empty'}}">
      <Icon name="database" size="{{22}}" />
      <text>没有充值订单。</text>
    </view>
    <view wx:else class="{{'tableWrap'}}">
      <view>
        <view>
          <view>
            <view>组织</view>
            <view>金额</view>
            <view>渠道</view>
            <view>商户单号</view>
            <view>状态</view>
            <view>创建</view>
            <view>付款</view>
            <view>入账</view>
          </view>
        </view>
        <view>
          <view wx:for="{{topups}}" wx:for-item="order" wx:key="order.id" key="{{order.topupOrderId}}">
            <view>
              <code>{{order.organizationId}}</code>
            </view>
            <view>{{yuan(order.amountMinor)}}</view>
            <view>{{order.provider}}</view>
            <view>
              <code>{{order.outTradeNo ?? "—"}}</code>
            </view>
            <view>
              <text class="{{order.status === &quot;PAID&quot; ? 'resultBad' : 'resultGood'}}">{{order.status}}</text>
            </view>
            <view>{{moment(order.createdAt)}}</view>
            <view>{{moment(order.paidAt)}}</view>
            <view>{{moment(order.creditedAt)}}</view>
          </view>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </block>
</view>
<view class="{{'panel'}}" aria-label="人工调整余额">
  <view>
    <view>
      <text class="overline">MANUAL ADJUSTMENT</text>
      <view>人工调整余额</view>
    </view>
    <text>需要 APPROVER + 平台管理员 · 不可撤销</text>
  </view>
  <view>这是这个子系统里唯一一个在别处没有对照记录的动作：没有支付流水，没有任务， 事后能对账的只有管理员打进去的那句原因。所以原因必填，且会写进客户可见的流水。 写错了不能删——只能再打一笔反向的。</view>
  <form wx:if="{{canAdjust}}" class="{{'financeActions'}}" bindsubmit="submitAdjustment">
    <text><text>组织 ID</text> <input value="{{target}}" aria-label="被调整的组织 ID" placeholder="org-xxxx" pattern="[A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9._:-]{0,127}" title="组织标识，例如 org-pre。" disabled="{{busy}}" required="true" bindchange="onChange" /></text>
    <text><text>方向</text> <view aria-label="调整方向" value="{{direction}}" disabled="{{busy}}" bindchange="onChange">
  <view value="CREDIT">增加 CREDIT</view>
  <view value="DEBIT">扣减 DEBIT</view>
</view></text>
    <text><text>金额（元，正数）</text> <input value="{{amountYuan}}" aria-label="调整金额（元）" inputMode="decimal" placeholder="100.00" disabled="{{busy}}" required="true" bindchange="onChange" /></text>
    <text><text>原因（客户可见）</text> <input value="{{reason}}" aria-label="调整原因" placeholder="补偿 2026-08-20 任务重复扣费" maxLength="{{200}}" disabled="{{busy}}" required="true" bindchange="onChange" /></text>
    <view>
      <button class="primary-button" type="submit" disabled="{{busy || !reason.trim()}}">
        <Icon name="{{busy ? &quot;refresh&quot; : &quot;check&quot;}}" size="{{17}}" />
        <text>{{busy ? "提交中…" : `提交${direction === "CREDIT" ? "增加" : "扣减"}`}}</text>
      </button>
    </view>
  </form>
  <view wx:else class="{{'boundaryNote'}}">当前会话角色不足，只能查看。人工改余额需要 APPROVER，且账号还要在平台管理员名单上。</view>
</view>
